id: treacherous-spikes-fourth-effect
name: Treacherous Spikes
type: standard
actionCost: 1
kiCost: 0
attacking: false
requiresTarget: false
usageLimit: 1/round
fromTrait: treacherous-spikes
fromEffect: 4
source: Core Rule
description: >
  Treacherous Spikes' fourth effect, as a Maneuver: a Clash (Corporeal/Impulsive) at each targeted Opponent - won, 9(bT) off their Life, 1 off the Quillset's Break Value.
text: >
  (4)-[1/Round]: As a Standard Action with an Action Cost of 1 Action, either select an Opponent who is not at Long Range, or select all Opponents within a Large Cone AoE (starting from you). Make a Clash (Corporeal/Impulsive) against the selected Opponent(s). If you win, reduce their Life Points by 9(bT) and then reduce the Break Value for your Quillset by 1.

---

# The Opponents you have targeted - one not at Long Range, or all in a Large Cone, the table's; a Clash at each (chat.mjs quillBurst).
[on used]
quillBurst();
